{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2023-02-01 13:00:00', 'title': 'KROGER DELIVERY EXPANDS TO SOUTH FLORIDA', 'text': "GROCER OPENS NEW SPOKE ALSO SERVING MIAMI, FLORIDA AND SURROUNDING AREAS -- CELEBRATES 90 NEW ASSOCIATES MIAMI , FEB. 1, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE KROGER CO. (NYSE: KR), AMERICA'S GROCER, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE OPENING OF A NEW SPOKE FACILITY IN SOUTH FLORIDA. JOINED BY THE LOCAL COMMUNITY, KROGER CELEBRATED THE EXPANSION OF THE DELIVERY SERVICE AND WELCOMED 90 NEW ASSOCIATES."}